[{"title":"交趾和友人","author":"解缙","text":"香罗着体叠雪轻，赐出彤庭忆圣君。\n午夜薇垣清梦里，漏声犹似日边闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58635,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清远峡山寺","author":"解缙","text":"绕涧木犀冬着花，上方台殿頫烟霞。\n云迷石室和光洞，犹是轩辕帝子家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58636,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过南安 其一","author":"解缙","text":"少年见说张横浦，曾访南安旧谪居。\n趺迹宛然存石础，至今重到已成墟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58637,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过南安 其二","author":"解缙","text":"黄金市镇水湾环，屋瓦高低竹树间。\n西北有峰如翠黛，舟人说是酒墰山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58638,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过南安 其三","author":"解缙","text":"六出飞花玉满汀，碧波江上晚扬舲。\n羊裘不怕江风冷，但看天边兆客星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58639,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过十八滩","author":"解缙","text":"白浪滩滩跳雪珠，青山片片翠萦纡。\n杜鹃啼得花如血，正是行人在半涂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58640,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"交趾还途中赠士谦 其一","author":"解缙","text":"碧落嬉游大醉中，偶来岭外寄行踪。\n玉堂金马频频梦，黄菊青樽处处逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58641,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"交趾还途中赠士谦 其二","author":"解缙","text":"处士年年种菊枝，几回霜雪满东篱。\n春风天上移根种，又见新承雨露时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58642,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"交趾还途中赠士谦 其三","author":"解缙","text":"二十年前处士家，淋漓宫锦醉黄花。\n即今童稚皆成长，留客焚香细煮茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58643,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤壁","author":"解缙","text":"芦荻烧残孟德舟，洞箫吹彻子瞻愁。\n昨从赤壁矶头过，水冷鱼惊月一钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58644,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九华山","author":"解缙","text":"忽报荆山有堕弓，生民挥泪湿秋风。\n孤臣泪尽丹心在，一似扶桑晓日红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58645,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日南还纪程 其一","author":"解缙","text":"庐阜横江气势雄，飞流银汉与天通。\n八千里外南归客，肯靳鄱阳一夕风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58646,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日南还纪程 其二","author":"解缙","text":"曾上松湖看赤城，仙人道士远相迎。\n一樽元酒十年醉，此日经过始解酲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58647,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孤鸦图","author":"解缙","text":"栖迟顾影自堪怜，肯逐群飞噪野田。\n海色曈昽朝雨歇，又随红日上青天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58648,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹","author":"解缙","text":"河湟雪压松千尺，不似江南竹一枝。\n龙卧肯随风浪起，朝阳还有凤来时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58649,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题芦雁图 其一","author":"解缙","text":"閒随明月宿芦花，摇落江南未怨嗟。\n万里不辞天路远，帛书曾到帝王家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58650,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题芦雁图 其二","author":"解缙","text":"霜影沉沉起暮寒，秋云荷叶护阑干。\n形骸已在希夷外，不怕王孙金弹丸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58651,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题青山白云图送廷琛","author":"解缙","text":"宦游谁不爱青山，世上浮名好似閒。\n绾住白云岩际宿，任他流水去人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58652,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行题扇 其一","author":"解缙","text":"行藏用舍皆由命，舒卷炎凉动合宜。\n莫向秋风怨摇落，明春还发上林枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58653,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行题扇 其二","author":"解缙","text":"记得天门颁赐时，翚飞凤羽下龙墀。\n只今流落江南去，还有清风及四夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58654,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题石田茅屋图","author":"解缙","text":"石田茅屋归来计，长日呼龙种玉芝。\n高卧熟眠应不忘，五更风雨道涂时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58655,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏綵堂","author":"解缙","text":"春风庭砌长兰苕，堂上慈亲冠凤翘。\n綵服尊前映朝日，回銮紫诰下青霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58656,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蔡君谟真迹 其一","author":"解缙","text":"汴水东流宋社移，中郎名字日星垂。\n精神翰墨犹生气，想见彤庭赐对时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58657,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蔡君谟真迹 其二","author":"解缙","text":"端明书法继钟王，佩玉琼琚在庙堂。\n见说当年推第一，米家应自笑疏狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58658,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为王衡题画竹","author":"解缙","text":"美人手持白纨扇，画出亭亭竹数竿。\n为爱此君心事好，最宜炎暑最宜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58659,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蔡学渊墨竹","author":"解缙","text":"能画故人今不见，空馀翰墨寄高情。\n何时归到螺江上，共倚琅玕听凤鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58660,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪竹双禽图 其一","author":"解缙","text":"雪压筼筜翠叶低，文禽声寂不闻啼。\n上林春好无情到，荆棘丛卑只共栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58661,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪竹双禽图 其二","author":"解缙","text":"翠竹寒消雪未收，双栖梦醒更何求。\n君王六合皆灵囿，饮啄飞翔得自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58662,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菜","author":"解缙","text":"蔬茹甘香可疗饥，莫云长是在茅茨。\n调羹宝鼎挥金椀，肉食曾无厌饫时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58663,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题贤母卷","author":"解缙","text":"吾伊声断熊丸胆，灯火烟消墨篆帷。\n不但古人有贤母，看碑挥泪痛慈闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58664,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题观奕图","author":"解缙","text":"去年曾到烂柯山，看着残棋不肯还。\n自是太平舒化日，神仙都只在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58665,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题岁寒图","author":"解缙","text":"群芳摇落尽凋残，唯有孤松耐岁寒。\n为道沧洲深雪里，独留苍翠与君看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58666,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松","author":"解缙","text":"石上青松百尺长，松花落涧水生香。\n丁宁樵斧休戕伐，留待他年作栋梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58667,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹","author":"解缙","text":"修篁解箨出林梢，劲节扶疏长凤毛。\n伫看他年坚似玉，裁竿东海钓金鳌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58668,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桂","author":"解缙","text":"桂树团团翠欲流，灵根原自月中求。\n东风吹动黄金粟，散作人间富贵秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58669,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅","author":"解缙","text":"潇洒寒梅吐玉葩，暗香浮动老仙家。\n应知鼎鼐调羹味，几向园林傲雪华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58670,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和山阴宋太史韵 其一","author":"解缙","text":"大秀千峰菡萏开，玉梁高接九仙台。\n预从山顶结茅屋，待等先生跨鹿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58671,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和山阴宋太史韵 其二","author":"解缙","text":"令子能书逼右军，新诗妙墨总超群。\n明朝又向江头别，遥望文星隔五云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58672,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题卓撒","author":"解缙","text":"一斧不成两斧成，暂于低处立功名。\n虽然未得居台辅，且在人间正不平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58673,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨鹰 其一","author":"解缙","text":"凛凛东风日未西，珊瑚枝上暂幽栖。\n千山万怪藏踪迹，野旷青天不敢啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58674,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨鹰 其二","author":"解缙","text":"黑鹰度海下林峦，怒目雄惊胆气寒。\n良史笔端参造化，为留英气画中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58675,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"解缙","text":"楼观青红锁翠烟，树寒浓郁障空天。\n此中谁是孤休客，还有严装下濑船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58676,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"退朝即事 其一","author":"解缙","text":"少年天子重边功，亲到凌烟画阁中。\n敕赐勋臣绘图本，常将殿扆作屏风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58677,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"退朝即事 其二","author":"解缙","text":"延英影对碧衣郎，端砚纤毫各别床。\n天子垂帘亲考试，宫人手里过茶汤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58678,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"退朝即事 其三","author":"解缙","text":"云驳花骢各试行，一般毛色一般缨。\n殿前来往重骑过，欲得君王别赐名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58679,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬某明府 其一","author":"解缙","text":"都门卿相尽弹冠，剩有文章送县官。\n他日轺车采循吏，蒲鞭应尚笑刘宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58680,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬某明府 其二","author":"解缙","text":"赵广文来辱寄诗，开缄云采动涟漪。\n字江不用栽棠树，丹桂林中寄一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58681,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送镏若斋 其二","author":"解缙","text":"万柳千花拂酒旗，南陵北苑草离离。\n居庸关下泉呜咽，又是东风欲去时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58682,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友 其一","author":"解缙","text":"昨日金门进讲书，君辞丹扆下阶除。\n遥知綵服趋庭日，何异神仙上碧虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58683,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友 其二","author":"解缙","text":"祖帐高歌易水滨，风波萍梗旧雷陈。\n明年定有归来日，共醉青湖玉带春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58684,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄友 其三","author":"解缙","text":"黄金径拟飧秋菊，紫翠楼将倚晚松。\n听彻雨声旋入梦，唤醒恨杀五更钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58685,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄于仲宽","author":"解缙","text":"欲写乡书寄故园，行人已远意空存。\n举头忽见南来雁，个个随君度塞门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58686,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游采石古塘寺","author":"解缙","text":"古塘姑熟小江边，一路芭蕉绿更妍。\n破衲老僧馀九十，细谈太祖渡江年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58687,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过池州","author":"解缙","text":"日日南风送客舟，舒州才过又池州。\n九华云捲芙蓉帐，挂在青天白玉钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安庆道中 其一","author":"解缙","text":"半帆初日皖州城，千古英雄此用兵。\n金阙剑光腾紫雾，龙眠山色趁新晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安庆道中 其二","author":"解缙","text":"连日桐城阻去舟，长江无奈拍天浮。\n川灵解识朝天客，数遣风涛着意留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小孤山","author":"解缙","text":"彭湖水合大江东，孤柱中流势独雄。\n千古狂澜资汝障，不徒行客仗灵风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鞋山","author":"解缙","text":"凌波仙子夜深游，遗得仙鞋水面浮。\n岁久不随陵谷改，化为砥柱障中流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慧禄寺","author":"解缙","text":"慧禄寺前江水流，萋萋芳草满汀洲。\n十年不到临江郡，依旧青松接画楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新淦县","author":"解缙","text":"早春游望过欧潭，青竹红桃水似蓝。\n钓艇画船山色里，令人只是恋江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中哭沧江兄 其一","author":"解缙","text":"为忆螺陂字水西，兄为和墨我题诗。\n看山纵酒携宾客，此是平生得意时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中哭沧江兄 其二","author":"解缙","text":"生离死别太匆匆，兄骑西行我棹东。\n回首白沙江上路，夕阳黄叶怨秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中哭沧江兄 其三","author":"解缙","text":"弟兄同年复同道，对床风雨每相期。\n那知但隔篱东水，不见生离死别时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中哭沧江兄 其四","author":"解缙","text":"少小同游白下门，五人今有一人存。\n江山花柳年年发，折柳看花欲断魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中哭沧江兄 其五","author":"解缙","text":"共泛西昌月下舟，家贫为有稻梁谋。\n却云但得长如此，不愿人间万户侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中哭沧江兄 其六","author":"解缙","text":"共看芙蓉天马山，遥怜世上几人间。\n田家有酒邀皆去，尽醉相随步月还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中哭沧江兄 其七","author":"解缙","text":"冲虚观里看江涨，又上中华礼白云。\n还赴故人鸡黍约，沉沉春夜细论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中哭沧江兄 其八","author":"解缙","text":"到家几日南荒去，文水江头送别时。\n惆怅吞声泪垂血，此情只有两心知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人还山阴","author":"解缙","text":"金凤洲头倒玉壶，铜塘浦口送飞舻。\n他时记得分携处，花雨春深听鹧鸪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽凤岐父尹平御史 其一","author":"解缙","text":"凤衔丹诏下天来，圣主临轩策俊才。\n二十三年悲短命，乡人空望绣衣回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58704,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽凤岐父尹平御史 其二","author":"解缙","text":"青春白简绣衣郎，六月寒飞满面霜。\n文水东流有馀恨，此生不复见张纲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58705,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读柴望小传","author":"解缙","text":"故旧三丧不弃捐，柴君高望世人传。\n当时泪滴坟前土，应作黄金彻九泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58706,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题仲兄小像","author":"解缙","text":"彭城风雨夜连床，说尽眉山感雁行。\n亦记建文初二载，丹青曾画解中郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58707,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏小松","author":"解缙","text":"小小青松未出栏，枝枝叶叶耐严寒。\n如今正好低头看，他日参天仰面难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58708,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊茶陵","author":"解缙","text":"山绕荒村水绕城，蒻蓬藤簟水滩声。\n秋风淅沥秋江上，人自思乡月自明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58709,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白头鸟","author":"解缙","text":"风景萧条凤不鸣，双栖田野更关情。\n为谁愁得头先白，一段愁心画不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58710,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题许由弃瓢图","author":"解缙","text":"白云松下日逍遥，时掬清泉意更饶。\n借问先生行此乐，宫中圣主是唐尧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58711,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭季岳黄金华","author":"解缙","text":"旅邸魂惊月在床，昨宵梦里见黄香。\n废城衰柳空残雪，哭断斜阳过大梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58712,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄倪以孚","author":"解缙","text":"孔壁遗经义可寻，都因传注惑人心。\n从头且莫生枝节，记得全文直万金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58713,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忧患中寄友 其一","author":"解缙","text":"金屋晓寒龙砚湿，玉阶春暖燕泥融。\n如何一夜思乡梦，只在文山字水东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58714,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]